- Singleton `Psi`: **17,132/17,132 exactly zero**, with maximum absolute exact-Fraction residual `0/1`. This covered every singleton in the reconstructed bounded catalogues, although singleton rows are not serialized into C3 shards because the reader requires trainable C3 rows to have size at least two.
