+| Route | Groups | Disagreements | Fraction |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| C1 | 2,200 | 1,137 | **51.6818%** |
+| C2 | 2,200 | 1,216 | **55.2727%** |
+| C3 | 22 | 18 | **81.8182%** |
+
+These are measurements on this 22-anchor intersection, not the 93-anchor
+EXACTGEN2 panel.
