+- reader: PASS; source schema `mcrl-v025-stagec-source-row-v1`, coalition
+  schema `mcrl-v025-stagec-c3-coalition-shard-v2`;
+- arm inventory: `FULL`, `DROP_C1`, `DROP_C2`, `DROP_C3`,
