+### 4. Schema digests and C3 width
+
+Verified from the accepted corpus:
+
+- Q1 digest:
+  `c002ea883a4ab727f9e00cc15866f5b9d37abca645963fd3db2f2db7c6cc887a`,
+  width 16;
+- Q2 digest:
+  `a891dd9831d76bccd981cef054ff204fa1d49c3cf6e5f3265015f16f1057019c`,
+  width 22;
+- feature-manifest digest:
+  `6a584896aa9691a019ca8d8502a4d59bd096be37fb527ae13379e30fa2bb21f0`.
+
+Derived on paper, then checked in code:
+
+```text
+member_width = 2*16 + 6 = 38
+C3_width = 1 + 2*38 + 4*7 + (32*4 + 1) + 6 = 240
